564
00:26:46,750 --> 00:26:48,291
Kau bakal pergi sama gadis itu.

565
00:26:49,083 --> 00:26:50,208
Simpan ini buat dirimu sendiri.

566
00:26:51,958 --> 00:26:52,333
Simpan.

567
00:30:49,958 --> 00:30:50,750
Dah.

568
00:30:51,291 --> 00:30:51,833
Dah.

