1115
01:06:10,583 --> 01:06:12,125
Tidak perlu khawatir, ayo.

1116
01:06:18,708 --> 01:06:20,750
Tolong, Pak.

1117
01:06:21,000 --> 01:06:22,208
Tolong lepaskan, Pak.

1118
01:06:22,416 --> 01:06:23,458
Tolong lepaskan, Pak.

1119
01:06:34,291 --> 01:06:35,750
- Pergi ke pintu belakang.
- Siap, Pak.

1120
01:06:38,333 --> 01:06:40,041
