1142
01:10:02,083 --> 01:10:04,708
Saat baku tembak,
pelaku Kaali dan Mangal berhasil kabur.

1143
01:10:05,583 --> 01:10:07,750
Saat Vaaji ditahan dan diinterogasi,

1144
