dia dirawat di ICU.

1156
01:10:38,083 --> 01:10:40,125
Semoga lekas pulih.

1157
01:10:40,291 --> 01:10:43,375
Doa dipanjatkan atas nama
Departemen dan Pemerintah.

1158
01:10:43,666 --> 01:10:45,083
