1739
01:51:32,583 --> 01:51:33,333
Aku balik lagi.

1740
01:51:33,416 --> 01:51:33,916
Pergi & bayar.

1741
01:51:34,208 --> 01:51:34,875
Ambil, Nak.

1742
01:51:35,916 --> 01:51:36,666
